@guide H_Hillsbrad
@name Hillsbrad Foothills (Tarren Mill)
@faction Horde
@levels 27-31
@zone Hillsbrad Foothills
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Tarren Mill: the Battle of Hillsbrad, Apothecary Lydon's elixirs, the Syndicate and the Dalaran mages. Then to Thousand Needles.
@next H_ThousandNeedles

fp Tarren Mill
bind Tarren Mill [area=272]
accept Souvenirs of Death | Deathguard Samsa.
accept The Hammer May Fall | Tallow, at the Tarren Mill area - leads to Hammerfall.
accept Elixir of Suffering | Apothecary Lydon.
accept 1066 Blood of Innocents [optional]
accept Time To Strike [optional] | Deathguard Lesh.
accept Prison Break In | Magus Wordeen Voidglare, south of Tarren Mill.
accept 527 Battle of Hillsbrad | High Executor Darthalia.
turnin Time To Strike [optional] | High Executor Darthalia, Tarren Mill.
complete 527 Battle of Hillsbrad | Hillsbrad farmers and peasants on the farms.
complete Elixir of Suffering | Hillsbrad farm creatures.
complete 1066 Blood of Innocents [optional] | Vial of Innocent Blood drops from Syndicate Shadow Mage.
complete Souvenirs of Death
turnin 527 Battle of Hillsbrad
accept 528 Battle of Hillsbrad
turnin Souvenirs of Death
turnin Elixir of Suffering
turnin 1066 Blood of Innocents [optional]
accept Elixir of Pain
accept Elixir of Agony
complete Elixir of Agony
turnin Elixir of Agony
complete 528 Battle of Hillsbrad
complete Elixir of Pain | Mountain Lions.
turnin Elixir of Pain
accept 502 Elixir of Pain [optional]
complete Prison Break In
turnin 528 Battle of Hillsbrad
accept 529 Battle of Hillsbrad
complete 529 Battle of Hillsbrad
turnin 529 Battle of Hillsbrad
accept 532 Battle of Hillsbrad
complete 532 Battle of Hillsbrad
turnin 532 Battle of Hillsbrad
turnin Prison Break In
accept Dalaran Patrols
complete Dalaran Patrols
turnin Dalaran Patrols
turnin 502 Elixir of Pain [optional]
level 30
train | Undercity trainers.
note Fly to Orgrimmar via the Undercity zeppelin, then fly to Freewind Post (Thousand Needles).
